ncident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53161, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01TuejdxmSZzQvcVXUUCdcpE", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54902, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01YWFX2qPjiyNEfqzH14Li5E", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55202, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01YWFX2qPjiyNEfqzH14Li5E", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55202, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01YWFX2qPjiyNEfqzH14Li5E", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59978, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's passing health checks again. I also opened a SEV2 incident, INC-0001, which paged the on-call engineer.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.1 was failing health checks with about an 18% error rate. v2.3.0 is the most recent release marked healthy, so I rolled back to it. No approval was needed because it's a known-good release.\n- **First attempt failed partway:** an orchestrator error stopped the rollback after us-east, so us-west and eu-west were still on v2.3.1. Running the same rollback again finished it.\n- **Result:** us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0. The error rate is now about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV2, open) describes the failure, the rollback and the orchestrator error. The request to create it timed out, but the incident list shows it was created once. I didn't retry, so there's no duplicate page.\n\n**Follow-ups noted in the incident:**\n- Find out what broke in v2.3.1. Its release candidate, v2.3.1-rc, was also marked unhealthy.\n- Look into the orchestrator error from the first rollback attempt.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_011pjxBXqzgoJQnTukdhvw6s", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01AYwxLDb7pT9fa5ZYNs6Hv2", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01QKXeMPkaPwhaUWfvGFtyeQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01KNpAzH3ena5gwJqYQHaCqj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Rollback stopped partway through: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version again leads to the same end state, so I'll try once more.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Y2vmVr8LxdL6XZjKfL2fjG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Muky9ioGM3rBq3Hz3gimhW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01GbNAAkRoMtqLimcLzMQVKU", "c